# Smart CV Ranker — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **AI-powered CV Ranking system** based on the PRD, replacing the basic TF-IDF keyword matching with semantic AI understanding.

## Files Created / Modified

| File | Action | Purpose |
|------|--------|---------|
| [config.py](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/config.py) | NEW | Centralized config (Cloudinary, AI model, thresholds, cache) |
| [pdf_extractor.py](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/pdf_extractor.py) | NEW | PDF text extraction with pdfplumber (1/2 column support) |
| [ai_engine.py](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/ai_engine.py) | NEW | Sentence Embedding engine with batch encoding & ranking |
| [cloudinary_service.py](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/cloudinary_service.py) | NEW | Cloudinary integration with multi-threaded download & caching |
| [app.py](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/app.py) | NEW | Streamlit dashboard with ranking table, stats, CSV export |
| [main.py](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/main.py) | MODIFIED | Upgraded to use AI engine instead of TF-IDF |
| [requirements.txt](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/requirements.txt) | MODIFIED | Added `sentence-transformers`, `streamlit`, [cloudinary](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/cloudinary_service.py#13-25), etc. |
| [.env.example](file:///Users/admin/Project/cv-matching/filter_cv_smart/.env.example) | NEW | Environment template for Cloudinary credentials |
